WEBVTT

00:00:00.730 --> 00:00:09.810
<i>The countless flowers,
enveloped in light…</i>

00:00:09.810 --> 00:00:20.340
<i>…gaze at tomorrow
with unwavering eyes.</i>

00:00:32.330 --> 00:00:39.350
<i>Everyone wishes for me to be pure…</i>

00:00:39.350 --> 00:00:46.810
<i>…but what can I bring
with me to the frayed skies?</i>

00:00:46.810 --> 00:00:53.900
<i>What I’ve made my own
by breaking off flowers in bloom…</i>

00:00:53.900 --> 00:00:59.530
<i>All such sinful things…</i>

00:00:59.530 --> 00:01:07.010
<i>Why did I stop making
promises with the future?</i>

00:01:07.010 --> 00:01:14.280
<i>Because even if I try
to run far from all the pain…</i>

00:01:14.280 --> 00:01:21.020
<i>…a cold wind rustles
my hair… Don’t you see?</i>

00:01:21.020 --> 00:01:28.450
<i>Where can I ever find the answer?</i>

00:01:37.460 --> 00:01:38.510
Hold on!

00:01:38.510 --> 00:01:39.540
Big Sister…

00:01:39.540 --> 00:01:43.290
I’m Para-sama’s pair! You can’t
just tell me to team up with Alty now.

00:01:44.480 --> 00:01:48.290
Regarding Paraietta,
you can easily be replaced.

00:01:49.920 --> 00:01:53.020
But no one can take
your place as sisters.

00:01:53.020 --> 00:01:57.570
The Ri Majon you inscribe will show
some interesting results, I’m sure.

00:01:58.580 --> 00:01:59.970
Sisters?

00:01:59.970 --> 00:02:04.930
This is all for the sake of restoring
Chor Tempest to its former prestige.

00:02:04.930 --> 00:02:07.420
We simply can’t
afford another fiasco.

00:02:11.960 --> 00:02:17.950
<b>Sisters</b>

00:02:18.800 --> 00:02:19.950
Yun!

00:02:20.570 --> 00:02:23.700
I can’t believe you’re pushing away
such tiny bits of onion like that!

00:02:25.170 --> 00:02:26.450
Leave me alone.

00:02:27.880 --> 00:02:30.850
Yun, I didn’t know
you could be so cute!

00:02:32.310 --> 00:02:34.960
So it really wasn’t
such a big deal, huh?

00:02:34.960 --> 00:02:39.380
Saying how in love you were, but
that’s how much you care in the end.

00:02:40.060 --> 00:02:42.800
— Mastiff! You’re so sweet!
— Killing other people…

00:02:43.430 --> 00:02:44.490
Kaim.

00:02:46.030 --> 00:02:49.980
What? Don’t lash out just because
your beloved Para-sama dumped you.

00:02:49.980 --> 00:02:50.940
Wha…

00:02:51.730 --> 00:02:52.940
Stop it right now!

00:03:11.420 --> 00:03:12.750
Big Sister…

00:03:20.060 --> 00:03:23.160
Oh, they’re finally back to normal now.

00:03:23.670 --> 00:03:27.270
Really… Putting up with
such barbarous treatment…

00:03:27.270 --> 00:03:28.520
I’m proud of you!

00:03:28.520 --> 00:03:33.210
Morinas, I can’t let you get away
with using the word “barbarous.”

00:03:40.180 --> 00:03:42.280
Hey… That’s unusual.

00:03:54.160 --> 00:03:55.290
Floe…

00:03:57.000 --> 00:03:58.050
Sorry.

00:03:59.800 --> 00:04:03.260
My sister didn’t mean to hurt you.

00:04:03.810 --> 00:04:05.550
— It’s just that…
— It’s all right.

00:04:07.540 --> 00:04:10.600
Because she’s right
about how much I care.

00:04:12.310 --> 00:04:16.180
I felt… like I was going
to burst inside, see…

00:04:17.590 --> 00:04:19.860
I thought my heart
was just going to stop…

00:04:20.900 --> 00:04:22.400
And yet…

00:04:24.760 --> 00:04:26.370
It didn’t stop.

00:04:28.160 --> 00:04:29.820
But the thing is…

00:04:33.300 --> 00:04:36.580
I just don’t want to ever
forget about that night.

00:04:37.570 --> 00:04:39.090
That’s how I feel.

00:04:41.340 --> 00:04:45.010
Not to forget… about that night…

00:04:46.110 --> 00:04:47.720
Big Sister…

00:05:01.300 --> 00:05:03.490
Come on, Floe. Left more.

00:05:03.490 --> 00:05:06.350
Why’s this boat leaking like this?

00:05:06.350 --> 00:05:10.950
I’m sure the Messis is quite pleased
having Simoun sibyllae help out.

00:05:10.950 --> 00:05:13.980
Unbelievable. I don’t see how it flies.

00:05:13.980 --> 00:05:14.960
My apologies.

00:05:15.410 --> 00:05:16.460
Where’s Kaim?

00:05:16.460 --> 00:05:20.170
Still sulking.
She really is a pain in the butt.

00:05:25.390 --> 00:05:26.680
There you are.

00:05:28.220 --> 00:05:31.140
Kaim, about tomorrow’s test flight…

00:05:31.140 --> 00:05:34.650
They’ve decided to send Aer
and myself to accompany you.

00:05:35.160 --> 00:05:38.060
Don’t you even care, Para-sama?
That I’m not your pair anymore?

00:05:38.540 --> 00:05:40.020
Calm down, Kaim.

00:05:40.020 --> 00:05:42.620
Don’t look at me like that!

00:05:42.620 --> 00:05:43.690
I’m sorry.

00:05:43.690 --> 00:05:45.510
It’s not your fault.

00:05:45.510 --> 00:05:47.070
Kaim…

00:05:47.910 --> 00:05:50.270
But it’s not my fault either!

00:05:52.530 --> 00:05:53.790
Kaim!

00:05:58.290 --> 00:06:00.600
She seems so upset.

00:06:00.600 --> 00:06:03.340
Maybe I should’ve
at least accompanied her.

00:06:03.340 --> 00:06:04.670
It wouldn’t do any good for you to go.

00:06:18.710 --> 00:06:20.600
Man, you busted it!

00:06:26.610 --> 00:06:32.090
Freezing! Jeez, we got rid of the rusty
water, and now there’s no hot water?

00:06:32.090 --> 00:06:33.590
What a bummer.

00:06:36.320 --> 00:06:38.190
Isn’t that water cold?

00:06:39.890 --> 00:06:41.130
It won’t wash off.

00:06:43.560 --> 00:06:45.290
I scrub and scrub…

00:06:46.530 --> 00:06:48.780
But no matter how much…

00:06:48.780 --> 00:06:50.130
…it just won’t wash off.

00:07:06.950 --> 00:07:09.150
Let’s get some sleep now.

00:07:10.490 --> 00:07:12.700
Rimone, aren’t you scared?

00:07:12.700 --> 00:07:15.160
You can come over to my bed.

00:07:15.900 --> 00:07:17.070
I’m okay.

00:07:17.070 --> 00:07:20.110
You don’t have to be brave.
After all, you’re still little…

00:07:20.110 --> 00:07:22.540
The truth is you’re
the one who’s scared.

00:07:23.170 --> 00:07:25.630
T-That’s not true…

00:07:38.090 --> 00:07:45.650
<i>Proof that an eternal world exists…</i>

00:07:46.190 --> 00:07:53.200
<i>…shall be revealed
by Tempus Spatium.</i>

00:07:53.730 --> 00:08:01.910
<i>Rocking gently
until we awake tomorrow…</i>

00:08:02.790 --> 00:08:06.640
<i>…protected by our mother.</i>

00:09:00.310 --> 00:09:01.350
What’s the matter?

00:09:01.950 --> 00:09:03.200
Nothing.

00:09:55.070 --> 00:09:59.070
This is the first time, isn’t it?
That we’ve flown together.

00:09:59.630 --> 00:10:01.580
It’s called “praying to the skies.”

00:10:02.600 --> 00:10:06.960
Big Sister… How did
we ever come to this?

00:10:09.540 --> 00:10:12.130
We used to always do things together.

00:10:16.880 --> 00:10:19.340
— It was that night…
— Shut up!

00:10:29.600 --> 00:10:31.100
Aer, after them!

00:10:40.110 --> 00:10:42.120
Aer, the communication cable!

00:10:42.120 --> 00:10:42.990
Right.

00:10:48.210 --> 00:10:49.960
Neviril, look!

00:10:51.110 --> 00:10:52.460
What’s happening?

00:10:58.320 --> 00:11:00.120
Kaim! Alty!

00:11:01.020 --> 00:11:05.980
Why? Why aren’t their prayers
being heard by the Simoun gem?

00:11:09.180 --> 00:11:10.980
They’re in the clouds…

00:11:10.980 --> 00:11:12.190
I won’t lose them.

00:11:16.020 --> 00:11:17.070
Big Sister!

00:11:17.070 --> 00:11:18.570
Don’t call me that!

00:11:20.360 --> 00:11:21.410
Big Sister!

00:11:21.410 --> 00:11:23.410
I said stop calling me that!

00:11:32.000 --> 00:11:33.330
I was right after all.

00:11:36.190 --> 00:11:38.640
You were to blame after all.

00:11:38.640 --> 00:11:41.680
Alty… It’s all your fault.

00:11:42.460 --> 00:11:45.390
That’s right… It was all…

00:11:45.390 --> 00:11:47.390
It was all because of you!

00:11:53.770 --> 00:11:55.020
What could that be?

00:12:42.990 --> 00:12:47.160
Wow… it’s as
dilapidated as the Messis.

00:12:47.160 --> 00:12:49.900
Still, what the heck is it?

00:12:49.900 --> 00:12:52.620
It’s Shoukoku’s aerial base.

00:12:52.620 --> 00:12:58.000
But who would’ve thought
a base this size even existed?

00:12:58.000 --> 00:13:02.610
They don’t seem to have spotted us,
even though we’re so close.

00:13:02.610 --> 00:13:04.010
Shall we explore?

00:13:04.010 --> 00:13:10.020
No, it’s risky. With the other Simoun’s
oddness, let’s return to the Messis…

00:13:10.020 --> 00:13:14.020
It was useless from the start. Even
Dominüra should be able to see that.

00:13:14.020 --> 00:13:16.770
We may be sisters, but still…

00:13:22.700 --> 00:13:24.780
I’m going.

00:13:25.360 --> 00:13:26.490
Alty?

00:13:27.300 --> 00:13:32.540
I’ll show Dominüra that it’s
not impossible for us to be a team.

00:13:35.110 --> 00:13:39.250
Leave it to me.
Aer and Kaim will wait in the Simouns.

00:13:39.920 --> 00:13:42.930
We’ll approach at a slow
pace and then move in.

00:13:42.930 --> 00:13:44.260
If something happens…

00:14:24.430 --> 00:14:26.300
It looks deserted.

00:14:26.300 --> 00:14:27.660
You’re right.

00:14:28.220 --> 00:14:29.260
What’s that?

00:14:32.800 --> 00:14:35.140
A broken searchlight…

00:14:35.140 --> 00:14:37.550
A base left unguarded…

00:14:37.550 --> 00:14:42.380
So we’re suffering at the hands
of people like this, aren’t we?

00:14:42.380 --> 00:14:43.520
Yes.

00:14:43.520 --> 00:14:48.420
How can they even confront
our divine vessels in battle?

00:14:48.420 --> 00:14:51.590
Maybe it’s not a matter
of who’s more powerful…

00:14:51.590 --> 00:14:53.740
Do you think they’re not afraid to die?

00:14:53.740 --> 00:14:57.290
I don’t think there’s
anyone who isn’t afraid to die.

00:14:57.290 --> 00:14:59.830
Then they must be strong.

00:15:01.000 --> 00:15:02.750
I’m envious.

00:15:04.870 --> 00:15:06.300
Alty…

00:15:12.040 --> 00:15:15.510
There’s no need to be
the strong one all on your own.

00:15:17.650 --> 00:15:20.740
It’s all Alty’s fault. That girl’s always…

00:15:21.980 --> 00:15:24.210
…always getting in my way.

00:15:24.900 --> 00:15:25.940
But why?

00:15:26.780 --> 00:15:28.990
Why does she always…

00:15:28.990 --> 00:15:31.240
What happened
between you and Alty?

00:15:33.190 --> 00:15:37.030
You two have this really weird vibe…
Even though you’re sisters.

00:15:38.100 --> 00:15:40.500
It’s because we are sisters.

00:15:41.400 --> 00:15:42.750
That night…

00:15:52.340 --> 00:15:55.260
That night, I was feeling vulnerable.

00:15:56.150 --> 00:15:59.500
I’d be going into my
first battle in the morning.

00:15:59.500 --> 00:16:03.960
And I was scared. I wanted
to scream. I wanted to run away.

00:16:04.830 --> 00:16:06.270
At that moment…

00:16:12.530 --> 00:16:14.320
She took advantage of me.

00:16:15.140 --> 00:16:16.780
I couldn’t say no to her.

00:16:17.450 --> 00:16:19.330
When Alty seduced me…

00:16:24.920 --> 00:16:26.720
I don’t really get it.

00:16:26.720 --> 00:16:30.890
I don’t blame you.
For sisters, it’s an abominable sin.

00:16:30.890 --> 00:16:32.970
That’s not what I’m talking about.

00:16:32.970 --> 00:16:36.890
Is it really a matter of who
was right and who was wrong?

00:16:36.890 --> 00:16:38.670
But of course…

00:16:38.670 --> 00:16:43.890
I can’t tell from just hearing this.
Maybe you really did the seducing.

00:16:45.700 --> 00:16:48.900
Seduced her? Me?

00:17:06.020 --> 00:17:08.990
I seduced her? That’s not possible.

00:17:09.760 --> 00:17:11.420
I couldn’t have…

00:17:11.420 --> 00:17:12.920
Kaim?

00:17:14.290 --> 00:17:16.260
I’ve got to make sure.

00:17:17.000 --> 00:17:18.600
I’ve got to bring Alty back.

00:17:18.600 --> 00:17:19.680
Hold on, Kaim!

00:17:20.220 --> 00:17:21.390
Kaim!

00:17:27.110 --> 00:17:31.600
When we were little,
I was always a little crybaby…

00:17:32.690 --> 00:17:34.610
And whenever I cried…

00:17:36.050 --> 00:17:38.700
…Big Sister would
always hold me close.

00:17:43.160 --> 00:17:44.580
And I became stronger.

00:17:50.230 --> 00:17:56.070
What I’d like to go back to isn’t that
night but a warm, cozy afternoon.

00:17:58.430 --> 00:18:04.010
What I want isn’t the hand that
taught me sensations I’d never known.

00:18:05.230 --> 00:18:08.440
It’s the gentle hand that
held mine as we walked.

00:18:11.400 --> 00:18:13.690
But… Big Sister…

00:18:15.620 --> 00:18:18.360
I want to become a man someday…

00:18:18.360 --> 00:18:21.160
So that next time,
I can hold her close.

00:18:21.660 --> 00:18:24.950
To hold Big Sister tight…

00:18:31.170 --> 00:18:32.670
Big Sister!

00:18:56.530 --> 00:18:57.760
Big Sister!

00:19:04.830 --> 00:19:06.410
Big Sister! Jump!

00:19:11.620 --> 00:19:15.340
Big Sister, what’s the matter?
You don’t have to worry!

00:19:15.340 --> 00:19:17.130
Because I’ll catch you
and hold you close!

00:19:26.010 --> 00:19:27.680
Big Sister!

00:19:28.890 --> 00:19:33.400
It’s not my fault…

00:19:51.410 --> 00:19:55.390
Kaim, as soon as we land,
act as Aer’s sagitta.

00:19:55.390 --> 00:19:56.920
Kaim! Got it?

00:19:57.880 --> 00:19:58.920
Yes.

00:20:35.430 --> 00:20:37.960
The Simoun gem was
unaffected by their prayers?

00:20:38.770 --> 00:20:43.370
I see… Have you ever heard
of that happening before?

00:20:43.370 --> 00:20:45.060
No, never.

00:20:46.710 --> 00:20:50.850
As for Shoukoku’s aerial base,
we can’t very well ignore it.

00:20:50.850 --> 00:20:54.230
Apparently there’s a new
class of aircraft on that base.

00:21:03.290 --> 00:21:07.850
To become strong by being held…
You’re wrong about that, Alty.

00:21:10.130 --> 00:21:13.080
It’s only when you’ve
both become strong…

00:21:13.080 --> 00:21:15.750
…that you can truly
hold each other close.

00:21:18.840 --> 00:21:21.420
Aer, is my sister all right?

00:21:21.420 --> 00:21:23.720
It was just a scrape.

00:21:23.720 --> 00:21:24.870
Thanks.

00:21:29.950 --> 00:21:34.270
Hey, you never got
to hold Amuria close, did you?

00:21:35.980 --> 00:21:38.770
Don’t worry. It’ll happen with us.

00:21:44.700 --> 00:21:47.530
The person you’re
looking at right now…

00:21:48.530 --> 00:21:52.370
…is someone who will never
grow old, and it’s you yourself.

00:21:55.380 --> 00:21:56.790
It’s not me.

00:22:33.210 --> 00:22:34.330
The same taste.

00:22:41.120 --> 00:22:47.830
<i>It is played by my wounds…
the song of prayer.</i>

00:22:47.830 --> 00:22:52.070
<i>Let it ring out over
the grieving universe.</i>

00:22:52.070 --> 00:22:59.140
<i>Can we change tomorrow?
Don’t be afraid.</i>

00:22:59.140 --> 00:23:06.740
<i>I want to let you know
how my heart’s overflowing.</i>

00:23:15.560 --> 00:23:19.630
<i>“I want to get closer to you.”
“I want to feel your pulse.”</i>

00:23:19.630 --> 00:23:24.800
<i>I was too defiant,
and I took the long way around.</i>

00:23:24.800 --> 00:23:28.780
<i>The blue moon is swaying silently.</i>

00:23:28.780 --> 00:23:32.820
<i>My true heart’s desire is you.</i>

00:23:32.820 --> 00:23:38.690
<i>I can’t reach you.
My tears of pain trickle down.</i>

00:23:38.690 --> 00:23:44.230
<i>Soar away into the sky, song of prayer.</i>

00:23:44.230 --> 00:23:47.660
<i>Carrying my love that came too late.</i>

00:23:47.660 --> 00:23:53.330
<i>What can I do to change tomorrow?</i>

00:23:53.330 --> 00:23:59.560
<i>Just hold on to “now” the way it is…</i>

00:24:04.920 --> 00:24:06.630
<b>To Be Continued</b>

00:24:07.040 --> 00:24:11.920
Neviril screams, losing her
head over something Aer says.

00:24:14.510 --> 00:24:16.100
Next time on Simoun…

00:24:15.430 --> 00:24:19.930
<b>Reason</b>

00:24:17.050 --> 00:24:18.690
Reason.
